  "version": "sketch/3",
  "title": "Funnel Into Doubt, Looping Back",
  "caption": "A funnel from the question of machine consciousness, through the psychological biases that make us believe in it, into four separate doubts about computation, opening into two live ethical worries that sit side by side rather than resolving, and finally looping back to the opening question of what makes us human.",
